#. ja: 私はナル！  生を司る神なり！
#. de: Ich bin Nald, Gott des Lebens!
#. fr: Je suis Nald, et je règne sur la vie<nbsp>!
#. speaker: NALDTHAL
msgctxt "cut_scene/061/VoiceMan_06101:TEXT_VOICEMAN_06101_000010_NALDTHAL:1"
msgid "I am Nald, keeper of the realm of the living."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 私はザル――死を司る神なり――
#. de: Ich bin Thal ... Gott des Todes.
#. fr: Je suis Thal... Je règne sur la mort...
#. speaker: NALDTHAL
msgctxt "cut_scene/061/VoiceMan_06101:TEXT_VOICEMAN_06101_000020_NALDTHAL:1"
msgid "I am Thal, keeper of the realm of the dead."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 汝ら  人の力を裁定いたそう
#. de: Dies ist eine Probe Eures Könnens.
#. fr: Humains... Préparez-vous à être jugés...
#. speaker: NALDTHAL
msgctxt "cut_scene/061/VoiceMan_06101:TEXT_VOICEMAN_06101_000025_NALDTHAL:1"
msgid "Prepare to be judged, children of man."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 合格だ  人の子らよ――
#. de: Sterbliche ... Ihr habt bestanden.
#. fr: Vous avez su prouver votre valeur...
#. speaker: NALDTHAL
msgctxt "cut_scene/061/VoiceMan_06101:TEXT_VOICEMAN_06101_000030_NALDTHAL:1"
msgid "You have been found worthy."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 祈りの力  希望の光か――<br>そんなものは  この暗き底へ  届きはしない！
#. de: <i>Hoffnung</i>? Habt ihr denn immer noch nicht verstanden?<br>Kein Licht dringt durch die Schwärze dieser Ver<shy>zweif<shy>lung!
#. fr: Une prière...<nbsp>? Croyez-vous sincèrement que votre frêle flambeau d'espoir soit capable de percer la noirceur qui règne en ce lieu<nbsp>!? Jamais<nbsp>!
#. speaker: ENDSINGER_NONE_VOICE
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "cut_scene/061/VoiceMan_06101:TEXT_VOICEMAN_06101_000040_ENDSINGER_NONE_VOICE:1"
msgid "Hope, is it...? Futile. Utterly futile.<br>Such feeble light is powerless before darkest despair."
msgstr ""
